    <briefdescription>
<para>Verifies that a named dependency meets a minimum version requirement. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Versions are compared lexicographically as dot-separated integers (e.g. &quot;1.4.0&quot; &lt; &quot;1.10.0&quot;).</para>
<para>The <computeroutput>version_provider</computeroutput> callback returns the currently installed version string for <computeroutput>dep_name</computeroutput>. An empty string means the dependency was not found and the check fails. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
